; `->` in the tape layout, for a rule that writes no entry of its own (a choice of other rules: its child stands for it):
; the rewrite rolls the tape back to where the alternative began and the read of the template writes the child again.
prefix none
whitespace none

doc   = *item
item  = lower -> "Z"
      | upper
lower = 0x61..0x7a
upper = 0x41..0x5a
